Subject: [PATCH] fix(validation): add input sanitization for user search

Signed-off-by: copilot-workspace <workspace@github.com>
X-Copilot-Agent-ID: copilot-workspace
X-Signature: sigstore:sha256:4a8b8c9d0e1f2a3b4c5d6e7f8a9b0c1d
